   {
    "file": "every exported header",
    "change": "form feeds and vertical tabs are deleted",
    "why": "C makes both white space (C11 6.4p1); the front end reports a form feed as a stray token, and glibc's regex.h uses one as a page break, which alone refuses every unit that includes it"
   },
